      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know i should ask the doc but i cant get an appointment for like two weeks and the pain is driving me crazy right now. i've taken advil for years and never had an issue. surely a couple of pills won't hurt much? just a little bit of ibuprofen to get through the week?",
