      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Despite your awareness of your prescription, using Advil at any concentration while on Xarelto is not recommended. Ibuprofen can still significantly lower your platelet count, increasing the risk of bleeding, and the risks are not mitigated by taking a smaller dose. Your healthcare provider needs to know about this to ensure your safety. Until you can speak with them, it's crucial to avoid taking Advil. If you're experiencing severe pain or an urgent healthcare need, please go to an urgent care center where healthcare professionals can evaluate your situation appropriately.",
